&lt;p&gt;It is &lt;strong&gt;Day 118&lt;/strong&gt; of my software engineering sprint, and today I unlocked the superpower of Reactivity! Today, I moved beyond standard event-listening log displays and dived deep into &lt;strong&gt;State Management using the &lt;code&gt;useState&lt;/code&gt; Hook&lt;/strong&gt;! ⚛️ dynamic&lt;/p&gt;

